Abort instead of pushing if the `git rev-parse origin/<%= head_ref %>`
SHA from your second fetch differs from the one captured immediately
after the first fetch — that comparison is the authoritative
remote-changed check; do not rely on judgement alone.

<% if dry_run -%>
Dry-run mode is active. Do not run git push, gh pr comment, gh pr edit,
